# Scratch for driving the clipping pipeline against real footage: source
# video, cut WAVs, compiled ESM and the clips it produces. Hundreds of
# megabytes, all of it regenerable, and none of it belongs in the repo — it
# sat untracked at 459MB while `git add -A` was one keystroke away.
_harness/

# Packaged builds. Produced by `npm run package`, named after the manifest
# version, and regenerated on demand — a binary in git that a command rebuilds
# is a merge conflict waiting to happen.
autoflow-studio-*.zip
